###############################################################################
# WombCare — .gitignore
#
# Rule of thumb: if a file can be regenerated by running a tool, it does not
# belong in git. A freshly cloned repo plus a prepared host PC must build.
# See docs/repository-guidelines.md.
###############################################################################

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Vendored SDKs — restored by Simplicity Studio / `slc generate`, not by git.
#    Together these were ~830 tracked files and the bulk of the repo size.
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
simplicity_sdk_*/
aiml_*/

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Generated code — produced by `slc generate` from the .slcp.
#    Committing it makes every diff dirty and hides real changes.
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
autogen/
**/autogen/*.crc
RTE_Components.h

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Build outputs
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/build/

# The whole cmake_gcc/ tree is `slc generate` output. Two of its files even say
# "Automatically-generated file. Do not edit!" in their header. Regenerate with:
#   cd projects/wombcare-firmware
#   slc generate Wombcare_PreFinal2.slcp -d . --with <board-or-part>
cmake_gcc/
*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.s37
*.map
*.a
compile_commands.json
**/GNU ARM v*
**/IAR ARM*

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. IDE / tooling state — machine-specific, never shared.
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.settings/
.projectlinkstore
.silabsExtContext
**/.projectlinkstore
**/.settings
**/.makefile
**/.trash
**/.uceditor
**/sonar-bw/
*.launch
*.orig
*.bak

## Enable these if you are not tracking the Simplicity Studio project files
# **/.cproject
# **/.project
# **/.pdm

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Python (ml/ and tools/)
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Datasets — large and reproducible, fetched by script rather than stored.
#    projects/wombcare-ml/tools/dat/
#        -> python projects/wombcare-ml/tools/download_data.py   (PhysioNet)
#    projects/wombcare-ml/tools/processed_dat/
#        -> python projects/wombcare-ml/tools/waveform_processing.py
#
#  Leading **/ matters: a pattern with an interior slash is anchored to this
#  file's directory, so a bare `tools/dat/` would NOT match at project depth.
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/tools/dat/
**/tools/processed_dat/
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Documentation formats that do not diff.
#    Docs are Markdown + Mermaid; see docs/repository-guidelines.md.
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.doc
*.docx
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.pdf
*.html

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. OS cruft
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
